  "title": "The history of the Tusset Chapel",
  "subtitle": "From the pilgrimage chapel on the Tussetberg to the reconstruction in Philippsreut",
  "description": "All chapters on the history of the Tusset Chapel: the old pilgrimage chapel in the Bohemian Forest, the expulsion, the reconstruction of 1983 to 1985 in Philippsreut, and the people who made it possible.",

  "intro": [
    {
      "t": "p",
      "lede": true,
      "html": "The history of the Tusset Chapel is recorded in the accounts of contemporary witnesses: by Otto Veith of Wallern, by Rosl Tahedl of Guthausen, and by Emil Weber himself, who documented the reconstruction in a photographic report. All texts on these pages are translations of the German originals."
    }
  ],

